Program: SecDec
Authors: Sophia Borowka, Gudrun Heinrich, Stephen Jones, Matthias Kerner, Johannes Schlenk, Tom Zirke 
Version 3

---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
INSTALLATION: 

make

Prerequisites: 
Mathematica
Perl
C++/Fortran compiler
       
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
USAGE:

to calculate loop integrals: 
go the the directory "loop" and see README there.
Examples for the loop setup are in loop/demos.

to calculate parametric integrals not related to loop integrals:
go the the directory "general" and see README there.
Examples for the "general" setup are in general/demos.
Contour deformation is not available for the general parametric integrals.
It is available however for the "userdefined" setup in the loop directory,
which goes beyond standard loop integrals.

 
